      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Most Americans would doubtless agree that positive change is a critical need in facilities providing long-term care. This article describes a project currently underway in which Midwest Bioethics Center (MBC) staff and Kansas City area experts in long-term care are doing their part to create meaningful change in the way residents of nursing homes are cared for in the last chapter of their lives."},
